Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 19:15:57 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 22/47] lakeside r4 land fill: flat emissive fill on the
 landform GLBs only, per mode from lakesideModeLighting

Grok Bot approved; global lights stay at r4. Land = landform GLBs: near LK_terrain (ground/grass),
far LK_far_hills + LK_far_shore (hills, mountains, snow). Not land: water, bridge, buildings, props,
vegetation, rocks, clouds. enableLakesideInstancing (board AND journey) gives land its own copy per
class (emissive white x emissiveScale = fill, linear, pre-tonemap); the static merge keys by
material content so land stays in its own chunks. applyLakesideLandFill(root, mode) is the one
day/night writer (board applyDir, journey toggle listener). Unsupported material -> [QF_LAKE]
land-fill-unsupported. Day near 0.104/0.196/0.025, far 0.043/0.087/0.107; night near 0/0/0.0014,
far 0.0049/0.0116/0.0356 (cool).
